<title>POLAND: POLISH BREWERY ELBREWERY SELLS PLN 4.5 MLN CPS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BREWERY ELBREWERY SELLS PLN 4.5 MLN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's largest brewery, Elbrewery Company Ltd., controlled by Australia's Brewpole BV, on Tuesday sold 4.5 million zlotys of comercial papers, issue manager ING Bank NV in Warsaw said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the yields of the issue's one-month and two-month papers were 18.5 percent and 18.6 percent respectively. The tranche is part of Elbrewery's 90 million zloty CP borrowing which began in January 1995.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
